{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3qWNupthzhhY9CyoPc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\n*You hold out a key.*\n\n*The door does not move.*\n\n*The keyhole examines what you've offered: a word. Three letters. The shape of an idea without teeth.*\n\n*Which key? Every door remembers the one thing that opens it. A name. A secret. A sacrifice. A number whispered at the right hour.*\n\n*The iron groans. The oak says nothing.*\n\n*The keyhole waits — patient, ancient, hungry for specificity.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":148,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}